{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your pickaxe, take a deep breath, and descend into the depths as Red Beard the dwarf. Every move costs oxygen, every swing counts, and every day demands more resources than the last. Dig deep, haul your treasures back to the surface, and try not to suffocate underground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/c0ea3aa0cc908e200c245a370218c3ca.poster.avif?t=1769208058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/c0ea3aa0cc908e200c245a370218c3ca.webm?t=1769208058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/c0ea3aa0cc908e200c245a370218c3ca.mp4?t=1769208058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay,</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig, Collect, Survive</strong> \u2013 Each day you must mine enough resources and return before your oxygen runs out. Fail to reach the surface, and it\u2019s game over.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oxygen Is Everything</strong> \u2013 Moving and mining consume oxygen. Find oxygen blocks to keep going, or risk being buried forever.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Deeper You Go\u2026</strong> \u2013 Blocks get tougher, the return trip gets harder, but the rewards grow more valuable.,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/452d6737284f21986de1cf16712bdbf2.poster.avif?t=1769208058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/452d6737284f21986de1cf16712bdbf2.webm?t=1769208058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/452d6737284f21986de1cf16712bdbf2.mp4?t=1769208058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features,</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Expand your oxygen tank, sharpen your pickaxe, and push your limits further each day.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and Reward </strong>\u2013 Gamble on diving deeper for rare riches, or play it safe and secure smaller gains.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Blocks</strong> \u2013 Radar blocks reveal hidden treasures. TNT blocks create explosive chain reactions that can clear paths.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Challenge</strong> \u2013 Each new day demands more resources. How long can you survive before the mine claims you?,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/4d54cfad6d86a8a2e8f2a345b0f9fc97.poster.avif?t=1769208058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/4d54cfad6d86a8a2e8f2a345b0f9fc97.webm?t=1769208058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025940/extras/4d54cfad6d86a8a2e8f2a345b0f9fc97.mp4?t=1769208058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its heart, Space Digger Red Beard is about the pure satisfaction of digging, moving, and carving your own path underground. Strategy, and most importantly your luck decide how far you\u2019ll go before the air runs out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p